    <h1>Delete Your Account</h1>

    <p>
        If you would like to permanently delete your <strong>Cosmic Roller</strong> account
        and all associated game data, please follow the steps below.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Request Account Deletion</h2>

    <ol>
        <li>Email us at <a href="mailto:apps@lawnscote.com">apps@lawnscote.com</a>.</li>
        <li>Use the subject line <strong>"Delete My Account"</strong>.</li>
        <li>Include the email address associated with your Apple / Google Sign-In account.</li>
    </ol>

    <p>
        We will process your request as soon as possible.
    </p>

    <h2>What Data Will Be Deleted</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Your player profile.</li>
        <li>Your saved game progress.</li>
        <li>Your achievements and game statistics.</li>
        <li>Any other personal data associated with your game account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>

    <p>
        Account deletion requests are normally processed within 7 days.
        Backup data may be retained for up to <strong>30 days</strong> before being
        permanently removed.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
        <strong>Important:</strong><br><br>
        Deleting your game account only removes data stored by
        <strong>Cosmic Roller</strong>. It <strong>does not delete your Google
        account</strong> or any information stored by Google.
    </div>

    <h2>Need Help?</h2>

    <p>
        If you have any questions, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:apps@lawnscote.com">apps@lawnscote.com</a>.
    </p>

